DESCRIPTION:Come join us at the Millpond for a ranger led canoe trip. We wi
 ll go out to see some of the key landmarks on the Millpond and see what sig
 hts we can see. This program is suitable for those who are comfortable padd
 ling the Millpond already (If you are new to paddling\, consider our Canoei
 ng 101 series of programs!).\n\nGuests are encouraged to dress for the weat
 her. \n\nYou may bring your our canoe/kayak if avaliable. \n\nRegistration 
 is required for this event. To register\, please call the park visitor cent
 er at 252-357-1191
