DESCRIPTION:Don't miss NCMA Winston-Salem's first-ever Field Trip at the We
 st Salem Art Hotel. An artful lodging space and creative hub\, the hotel in
 cludes two Art/partments\, four ensuites\, an art gallery\, a gift shop\, a
 nd a solarium that doubles as an event space. With art exhibitions\, outdoo
 r film screenings\, and seasonal festivals\, the West Salem Art Hotel is a 
 home for community-centered experiences with art in Winston-Salem's West Sa
 lem neighborhood.
