DESCRIPTION:Join Ranger Fields and step back in time to explore an old road
  that early settlers took to enter Danbury. This will be a challenging loop
  hike with several creek crossings\, totaling approximately 3.5 miles. Hiki
 ng attire\, water\, and a hiking pole are recommended. This experience is f
 or the adventurous. To sign up for this hike or for any questions\, email J
 acob.fields@ncparks.gov
