BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
DESCRIPTION:2026 Service Symposium\n250 & Beyond: Our American Story\n\nA n
 ationwide celebration of service\nEvent date: April 24\, 2026 | 10am EDT\n\
 nJoin us for a FREE live broadcast from anywhere in the country of our land
 mark hybrid symposium\, a nationwide celebration of service.\n\nAs the nati
 on approaches its 250th anniversary\, the 2026 Service Symposium | 250 & Be
 yond: Our American Story serves as the culminating celebration of a movemen
 t launched in 2024 to honor and inspire the American spirit of service. Lea
 rn more about this movement.\n\nBy bringing together thousands of Americans
 —including students\, educators\, nonprofit leaders\, public servants\, and
  community members—we will reflect on our past\, highlight incredible acts 
 of service happening today\, and inspire the next 250 years of American ser
 vice.​​​\n\nWho Should Attend? \n\nThis celebration is for everyone! Whethe
 r you are a K-12 or higher education student\, an educator\, a volunteer\, 
 a philanthropic partner\, or a civic leader\, this event is designed for th
 ose committed to civic engagement\, education\, and community impact.\n\nRe
 ad about our 2024 Service Symposium to get a taste of what's in store for 2
 026.
DTEND:20260424T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035720Z
DTSTART:20260424T140000Z
LOCATION:
