DESCRIPTION:The North Carolina American Indian Heritage Commission will hol
 d its quarterly meeting on Thursday\, April 30\, 2026\, from 10:00 AM to 2:
 00 PM at the N.C. Department of Natural and Cultural Resources in Raleigh.\
 n\nThe meeting will include remarks from department leadership\, presentati
 ons on education and public history initiatives\, updates from Commissioner
 s\, and discussion of Commission business.\n\nThe Commission advises and as
 sists the N.C. Department of Natural and Cultural Resources in the preserva
 tion\, interpretation\, and promotion of American Indian history\, arts\, c
 ustoms\, and culture across North Carolina.\n\nLocation:\nN.C. Department o
 f Natural and Cultural Resources\nRoom 308\n109 E. Jones Street\nRaleigh\, 
 NC 27601\n\nThis meeting is open to the public.
