DESCRIPTION:The self-guided tour gives you the chance to see the interiors 
 of very special homes in the Downtown and DeGraffenried Historic Districts 
 not normally open to the public. Homes range from glorious to tiny\, from 1
 8th century to restorations in progress. These are livable family homes wit
 h rich stories and diverse architecture that illustrates New Bern's amazing
  history. Add creative floral arrangements\, live music\, gardens in bloom\
 , artists\, and historical churches to the mix for an unforgettable tour! M
 ore details coming soon!
DTEND:20260501T200000Z
