DESCRIPTION:POSTPONED UNTIL MAY -\n\nJoin us on Saturday May 2\, 2026\, fro
 m 7:00pm to 9:00pm at Morrow Mountain State Park for the Statewide Star Par
 ty! We’ll have activities focusing on our theme\, “Mission to the Moon\,” a
 nd stargazing. Representatives from the Charlotte Amateur Astronomers Club\
 , as well as local astronomers\, will be standing by to answer questions an
 d allow peeks through some high-powered telescopes! Meet in the large parki
 ng lot adjacent to our swimming pool. Participants are encouraged to bring 
 telescopes and binoculars. Please try to limit light pollution once it gets
  dark. See you there! Rain date: Saturday May 2nd\, 2026. The NC Science Fe
 stival’s annual Statewide Star Party is made possible through the generous 
 support of the NC Space Grant More information can be found here: https://n
 csciencefestival.org/events/statewide-star-party-morrow-mountain-state-park
 /
