X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours,Guided Tours
DESCRIPTION:A new guided tour centered on the horticultural practices of th
 e three groups of people once inhabiting this land: the Scots-Irish\, the C
 atawba\, and enslaved Africans. Join us in learning about how these three g
 roups used plants and herbs to sustain and heal their communities. The tour
  will run about 1 hour\, with a 30 minute hands-on demonstration/activity t
 o follow.\n\nTour begins at 3pm\n\nMay 9th\, 16th\, 23rd and 30th\n\n$10 fo
 r adults and\n\n$8 for seniors (65+) and $5 for youth (3-17)\, and military
 .
DTEND:20260509T203000Z
