BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
DESCRIPTION:Come sweat with us! This full body workout mimicking animal mov
 ements can help reduce visceral fat. The first 5-10 minutes will focus on s
 tretching and warming up our muscle groups. This will be followed by 10 min
 utes of body movement practice leading into a 20-minute circuit of those le
 arned movements\, known as an AMRAP (as many rounds/reps as possible). We’l
 l end with a 10-minute cool down. This will be physically challenging\, but
  movements can be modified. Meet in the open lawn near the Visitor’s Center
 . Program is weather dependent.
DTEND:20260513T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035723Z
