DESCRIPTION:What’s so special about fiddler crabs? Join us at the back porc
 h to discover the fascinating world of fiddler crabs\, where tiny creatures
  make a big impact on coastal ecosystems. Learn how their signature waving 
 claws\, burrowing habits\, and quirky behaviors help keep marshes healthy a
 nd thriving. This engaging program offers a closer look at these small but 
 mighty residents of the shoreline.
