 Exhibits & Tours,Guided Tours,Outdoor & Recreation,Outdoor Recreation (kaya
 k, paddle, hikes),Youth & Family Activities
DESCRIPTION:Meet a Park Ranger at the Beech Tree Trail trailhead in the par
 king lot to hike the 1-mile loop where you will discover the history of Elk
  Knob and the surrounding New River communities. The history of “The Lost P
 rovince” and geological history of Elk Knob will also be discussed. Close-t
 oed hiking shoes and drinking water are recommended for the hike. This prog
 ram is open to all ages!
DTEND:20260516T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035723Z
DTSTART:20260516T180000Z
GEO:36.333462;-81.696432
LOCATION:Elk Knob State Park
