DESCRIPTION:Pender County Parks and Recreation is hosting The Freedom Swing
  Homerun Derby on June 7 from 3 to 6 p.m. at Hampstead Kiwanis Park (Guine 
 Field).\n\nThe event features free activities\, games\, and prizes\, with d
 erby entry fees of $10 for adults and $5 for youth. Participants should bri
 ng their own bat.\n\nYouth rounds begin at 4 p.m.\, followed by adult round
 s at 5 p.m. Concessions will be available\, and registration can be complet
 ed online at www.pendercountync.gov/parksandrec
