DESCRIPTION:Marvin Tupper Jones of Chowan Discovery will explore the legacy
  of the Juneteenth Soldiers—USCT members who fought for freedom and justice
  during the Civil War. Jones is a native of Cofield\, NC and has spent much
  of his life photographing\, documenting\, and researching the history of t
 he “Winton Triangle” area.
DTEND:20260611T110000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035728Z
DTSTART:20260611T100000Z
