BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours,Exhibitions
DESCRIPTION:March 14 – August 23\, 2026\n\nIn the ultimate battle for survi
 val\, every animal has a plan.\n\nExplore the striking ways nature fights b
 ack in “Staying Alive\,” featuring 17 live animals from around the world wi
 th unbelievable self-defense strategies. Come face to face with trippy toad
 s\, armored armadillos\, a two-toed sloth and more.\n\nDiscover how these d
 efenders deploy an amazing arsenal of high-fashion camouflage and mimicry\,
  specialized armor and advanced chemical warfare – like stink bombs\, caboo
 se cannons and smoke screens – to hide in plain sight\, stand their ground 
 or even drop a limb and make a run for it. Enjoy live animal encounters\, l
 arger-than-life sculptures\, 3D tactile experiences and interactive program
 s.\n\nPerfect for families and animal enthusiasts of all ages. Offered in E
 nglish & Spanish.
DTEND:20260612T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035728Z
DTSTART:20260612T140000Z
GEO:35.782156;-78.639336
LOCATION:North Carolina Museum of Natural Sciences
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Staying Alive 
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52207082983679
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/staying-alive
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
DESCRIPTION:"Hey you guys!" Ready for a legendary treasure hunt? Join us at
  Museum for a special screening of the 80s adventure classic\, The Goonies.
 \n\n \n\nGather your crew\, grab some popcorn and relive the magic of One-E
 yed Willy’s hidden gold on the big screen. Before the movie\, explore the M
 useum’s own "hidden treasures" with themed activities that bring the movie’
 s mysteries to life.\n\n \n\nEvent Highlights:\n\n• Feature Film: The Gooni
 es (Rated PG)\n\n• Themed Fun: Hands-on science led by Museum experts.\n\n•
  Snacks: Grab your favorite movie treats.\n\n• Movie Trivia: Prove you’re a
  real Goonie and test your knowledge.\n\n \n\nGet Your Tickets: https://ncm
 ns.net/GooniesMovie\n\n \n\nDon't let the Fratellis beat you to it — mark y
 our calendars and get ready for an adventure!
DTEND:20260613T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035728Z
DTSTART:20260612T213000Z
GEO:35.782156;-78.639336
LOCATION:North Carolina Museum of Natural Sciences
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Museum Movie Night: The Goonies
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52488054355575
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/museum-movie-night-the-goonies
END:VEVENT
