 Family Activities
DESCRIPTION:The North Carolina Symphony will perform a Patriotic Pops conce
 rt celebrating America 250. This program features patriotic favorites such 
 as Sousa’s “The Stars and Stripes Forever\,” John Williams’ “Liberty Fanfar
 e\,” the “Armed Forces Salute\,” and Copland’s “Buckaroo Holiday.”\n\nPack 
 your picnic! Summerfest offers great music under the stars at Koka Booth Am
 phitheatre in Cary—and remember\, kids 12 & under are always admitted free 
 on the lawn!\n\nNorth Carolina SymphonySophie Mok\, conductor Taylor Troyer
 \, vocalist
DTEND:20260613T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035728Z
DTSTART:20260613T000000Z
GEO:35.72899;-78.795431
LOCATION:Koka Booth Amphitheatre
