BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours,Exhibitions
DESCRIPTION:March 14 – August 23\, 2026\n\nIn the ultimate battle for survi
 val\, every animal has a plan.\n\nExplore the striking ways nature fights b
 ack in “Staying Alive\,” featuring 17 live animals from around the world wi
 th unbelievable self-defense strategies. Come face to face with trippy toad
 s\, armored armadillos\, a two-toed sloth and more.\n\nDiscover how these d
 efenders deploy an amazing arsenal of high-fashion camouflage and mimicry\,
  specialized armor and advanced chemical warfare – like stink bombs\, caboo
 se cannons and smoke screens – to hide in plain sight\, stand their ground 
 or even drop a limb and make a run for it. Enjoy live animal encounters\, l
 arger-than-life sculptures\, 3D tactile experiences and interactive program
 s.\n\nPerfect for families and animal enthusiasts of all ages. Offered in E
 nglish & Spanish.
DTEND:20260625T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035730Z
DTSTART:20260625T140000Z
GEO:35.782156;-78.639336
LOCATION:North Carolina Museum of Natural Sciences
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Staying Alive 
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52207082993930
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/staying-alive
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs,Lectures & Talks,Exhibits & Tours,Guided Tour
 s
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a tour of the Moravian Archives Vault featuring the
  collection materials from the Revolutionary War and early American History
 !\n\nGuests will walk through the Archives Vault which contains millions of
  records from the settlement of the Moravians here in North Carolina in the
  1750s on. Highlighted items will include correspondence from George Washin
 gton\, the Fourth of July Proclamation\, maps\, congressional records and m
 uch\, much more!\n\nLearn about Moravian History and the creation of our na
 tion while seeing how such collection materials are preserved for our poste
 rity!
DTEND:20260625T183000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035730Z
DTSTART:20260625T170000Z
GEO:36.089492;-80.241052
LOCATION:The Archie K. Davis Center 
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Tours of the Moravian Archives Vault -- America 250 Theme
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52004115327232
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/tours-of-the-moravian-archives-vault-a
 merica-250-theme
END:VEVENT
