BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Performances & Arts,Concerts (Music)
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate our nation's 250th birthday with "America’s Sweethear
 ts" as they bring timeless music to the Wake Forest Renaissance Centre stag
 e.\n\nThis charming\, vintage vocal trio delivers polished three-part harmo
 nies\, stylish period costumes\, and a love for the songs that helped defin
 e a nation. Featuring swing\, jazz\, and Broadway favorites\, their perform
 ance honors American musical heritage with warmth\, energy\, and heart.\n\n
 Audiences of all ages will enjoy this nostalgic and uplifting tribute to th
 e sounds that shaped generations. \n\nPlease contact the Box Office for any
  ADA or accessibility services needed. Staff are available M-F from 9 a.m.–
  12 p.m.\; 1-5 p.m.\n\nEmail: rcboxoffice@wakeforestnc.gov\n\nPhone: 919–43
 5–9458
DTEND:20260702T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035731Z
DTSTART:20260701T233000Z
GEO:35.97445;-78.508518
LOCATION:Wake Forest Renaissance Centre
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:America's Sweethearts
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52764163881591
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/americas-sweethearts
END:VEVENT
