DESCRIPTION:The Mountain Gateway Museum is having its first Pioneer Day sin
 ce Hurricane Helene. It will be on Friday\, July 3\, at 10am-4pm at 24 Wate
 r Street in Old Fort. It will have traditional Appalachian crafts\, live mu
 sic\, food trucks\, farm demonstrations\, children’s games\, and much more.
  It will also coincide with the state’s “America 250 NC” celebration on the
  July 4th weekend. As always\, admission is free!
