DESCRIPTION:Experience the best of North Carolina with DNCR at Capitol 250:
  NC Freedom Fest!  \n\nThis free\, all-day festival is a celebration of the
  arts\, history\, nature\, and culture that define North Carolina’s role in
  the nation’s story.\n\nDon’t miss live musical performances throughout the
  day\, sponsored by Bank of America. In addition to live music and cultural
  performances\, the festival features loads of family-friendly fun.\n\nThis
  downtown Raleigh celebration will complement a morning parade organized by
  the N.C. Department of Labor and evening fireworks at Dix Park organized b
 y the City of Raleigh.\n\nThis event is free and open to the public. We hop
 e to see you there!
DTEND:20260704T200000Z
