 eading of the Declaration of Independence will combine to make this a Fourt
 h of July to remember in the historic town of Halifax!  Continue the fun wi
 th the Town of Halifax’s celebration that afternoon and enjoy the annual fi
 reworks display\, at dark on the Halifax County Courthouse lawn. Free.
