DESCRIPTION:Part of Edenton's 4th of July Celebration\, please come help ce
 lebrate America's 250th Birthday on the water! Sponsored by Harbor Towns\, 
 Inc\, and benefitting the Edenton-Chowan Optimist Club 4th of July Celebrat
 ion. Show your American pride in our 'Anything Non-Motorized that Floats' P
 atriotic Costume Parade! There will be a grand prize for the winner(s)\, a 
 private chartered cruise on the Albemarle Queen! (Valued at $2\,000.00) Ext
 ra points will be awarded for 1776 and Revolutionary Themes\, as well as fo
 r the Edenton Tea Party - Colonial Women. The Edenton Yacht Club is providi
 ng maritime support.  \n\nEdenton's 4th of July Celebration: \n\nJoin us as
  we celebrate Independence Day...the Edenton way! Let the fireworks fly! Co
 me to downtown Edenton at Colonial Waterfront Park and celebrate the 250th 
 anniversary of our country. Visit local vendors\, get food downtown\, and i
 n the evening\, enjoy incredible fireworks with friends and family. All-day
  event - 9:00 am to 9:00 pm\n\nWhen is the Event? \n\nSaturday\, July 4\, 2
 026 - 9:00 am to 9:30 pm - floating parade time 2:00 pm - 4:00 pm\n\nWhere 
 is the event?\n\nColonial Waterfront Park\, 510 S Broad Street\, Edenton\, 
 NC\n\nFor More Information: 844-IBX-BOAT\n\nEmail info@harbortowns.org for 
 registration and regulations
DTEND:20260704T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035732Z
DTSTART:20260704T180000Z
