DESCRIPTION:This July 4th marks the nation’s 250th anniversary! Chapel Hill
  is celebrating with a new type of show that reimagines their long-standing
  community gathering.\n\nTechnology meets creativity in this year’s drone s
 how at Chapel Hill High School\, presented by Skyworx. A collection of 300 
 synchronized drones will lift off and arrange themselves into shapes and im
 ages\, using light and color to paint designs across the Chapel Hill sky.\n
 \nLearn more: https://www.chapelhillarts.org/calendar/july-4th/
