CATEGORIES:
DESCRIPTION:A Native of Rich Square\, NC\, Frank Womble is a retired Army L
 ieutenant Colonel\, last stationed at Fort Monroe. He now serves on the Boa
 rd of Directors for the American Friends of Lafayette. He was also Co-chair
  with Mrs. Womble of Suffolk events celebrating the 200th anniversary of La
 fayette’s visit to Suffolk. Mr. and Mrs. Womble were part of the reception 
 given to Lafayette when he arrived at New York and the send-off when he dep
 arted Washington\, D.C.
DTEND:20260709T110000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035732Z
DTSTART:20260709T100000Z
GEO:36.403559;-76.753059
LOCATION:2nd Floor - 1836 Gates County Historical Courthouse
SEQUENCE:0
