BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:
DESCRIPTION:Drop in between 1-3pm at The Iron Ore Belt Access to join Green
 sboro Astronomy Club members as we observe our planetÕs nearest star using 
 special solar viewing equipment. Please dress for hot\, sunny weather! NOTE
 : Program will be cancelled in the case of cloudy skies/rainy weather. Sign
  up at the Register link to be emailed in case of cancellation.
DTEND:20260718T190000Z
