BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours,Guided Tours
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a tour of Revolutionary War sites around downtown F
 ayetteville! From Liberty Point to Greene Street\, you will experience the 
 local stories of the American Revolution! \n\nRegistration is required. Cal
 l 910-483-7727 ext. 1365 or email lsh@cumberlandcountync.gov to register. T
 he tour will last around 2 hours. Moderate walking is required.
DTEND:20260724T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035733Z
DTSTART:20260724T140000Z
GEO:35.055443;-78.881263
LOCATION:Cumberland County Public Library
SEQUENCE:0
