BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations,Reenactments & Living History
DESCRIPTION:Want to protect yourself from getting a cold or learn about the
  medical issues our Founding Fathers had? Come to Hoggatt House and learn a
 bout the tinctures\, tonics\, and popular beliefs to prevent sickness in th
 e 18th and 19th centuries. FREE. All ages welcome. Drop-in.
DTEND:20260808T203000Z
