DESCRIPTION:Onslow County Museum\, in collaboration with the Onslow County 
 Historical Society\, is presenting Washington Slept Here: A Bus Tour\, foll
 owing the route through Onslow County locations that were part of George Wa
 shington's Southern Tour. This event is part of the museum's America 250 li
 neup. Spaces are limited. Registration is required. To join the tour\, cont
 act the Onslow County Museum at 910.324.5008.
