BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Transylvania Heritage Museum in Brevard for our 
 new exhibit celebrating America's 250th anniversary. Discover how Revolunti
 onary War veterans\, including Transylvania County Patriots\, carried the s
 pirit of liberty from battlefields into the rugged Appalachian frontier. Th
 rough artifacts\, stories and hands-on experiences - including our Revoluti
 on Era Garden - explore the journey from conflict to community in the mount
 ains we call home!\n\nOpen Thursday through Saturday 12 p.m. to 4 p.m. Free
  and open to all. Donations accepted
DTEND:20261015T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035736Z
DTSTART:20261015T160000Z
GEO:35.234922;-82.737524
LOCATION:Transylvania Heritage Museum 
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Battlefields to Backwoods Soldiers Shaping Applachia  Celebrating A
 merica's 250th
