 ures & Talks,Youth & Family Activities
DESCRIPTION:The High Country is filled with ghost stories and unexplained e
 ncounters. What stories have you been told? Come carve some Jack-o-Lanterns
  and share some spooky high country stories with us. This program will be a
 t The Park at Seven Devils. This is a Ranger Workshop with The Town of Seve
 n Devils. Limited spots\, please email amelia.gallina@ncparks.gov to regist
 er by October 22nd.
