BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs,Lectures & Talks,Outdoor & Recreation,Nature 
 & Wildlife Programs
DESCRIPTION:Become more Bear Wise and learn all about black bears physical 
 features\, behavioral patterns\, and how they change with age. We will also
  learn about prevention methods for both backcountry and rural settings\, a
 longside what to do if you encounter a bear in either setting. The Black Be
 ar program will be held at The Seven Devils Community Center as part of the
 ir Ranger Workshop Series.
DTEND:20261216T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035736Z
DTSTART:20261216T190000Z
GEO:36.1557;-81.799301
LOCATION:Seven Devils Community Center
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Ranger Workshop - Black Bears
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51815548059845
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/ranger-workshop-black-bears
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
CATEGORIES:Education Programs,Panels & Book Discussions
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for the June meeting of the America 250 NC Virtu
 al Book Club! We will be discussing Daughters of Green Mountain Gap by Teri
  M. Brown on December 16 at 6p.\n\nThis historical fiction novel\, based in
  North Carolina\, tells a story of generations of a women in one local fami
 ly. As natural learning vs university education clash in the two older wome
 n\, what is the third to think? Who will she follow? Is either path correct
 ? \n\nPlease read the book prior to the discussion. We recommend borrowing 
 from your local library. \n\nFree and open to the public. No membership req
 uired. Come to whichever book talks spark your interest. \n\nMeeting Link\n
 \nMore Information\n\nSign up for an Email Reminder
DTEND:20261217T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20260508T035736Z
DTSTART:20261216T230000Z
LOCATION:
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Virtual Book Club: Daughters of Green Mountain Gap by Teri M. Brown
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52808360219931
URL:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/copy-of-virtual-book-club-Daughters-of
 -Green-Mountain
END:VEVENT
