 ned\, protested\, and organized to expand democracy. The exhibit explores c
 hange\, freedom\, civic responsibility\, and overcoming challenges by telli
 ng the story of a few North Carolinians who have raised their voices to cal
 l out injustice and fully participate in our democratic society.
